Hi! My name's Nicholas; I'm a young programmer based in Toronto. I've spent 10 years developing
my coding skills through a huge variety of projects, you can check some of them out below. 

In addition to programming, I also love
physics, running, politics, speed skating, classic literature, and piano (among many others). Feel 
free to shoot me a message if any of that strikes your fancy!

This website was build using [DSADOS](https://github.com/depsysinc/dsados). It's a browser-based operating 
system that can be used to host websites. You might not be surprised
to hear that I helped develop it :). Whatever you do, don't press *q*.
